{
  "id": "10003",
  "key": "JS-3",
  "self": "https://your-domain.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/JS-3",
  "fields": {
    "summary": "Product reviews — write, like and edit",
    "issuetype": {
      "name": "Story"
    },
    "status": {
      "name": "Ready for QA"
    },
    "priority": {
      "name": "High"
    },
    "labels": [],
    "description": {
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Context"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Customers can review a product from its details dialog in the shop, like other customers' reviews, and edit their"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "own. Reviews are public, but writing, liking and editing are for signed-in customers only, and every review and like"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "must record truthfully who made it, because the marketing team shows \"most liked\" reviews and moderation relies on"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "the author field."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The shop runs in a throw-away environment created for this evaluation (a fresh container), so tests may create as"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "many customers and reviews as they need; nothing has to be deleted afterwards. Tests create their own customers with a"
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "unique e-mail per run; the password to use is provided out of band via the environment variable "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "JS_USER_PASSWORD",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            },
            {
              "type": "hardBreak"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use the product \"Apple Juice (1000ml)\" (product id 1) for every review."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The request and response details of the review endpoints are in the attachment "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "api-contract.md",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strong"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "attrs": {
            "level": 2
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Acceptance criteria"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableHeader",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "ID"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableHeader",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Criterion"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableHeader",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Layer"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-1"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A signed-in customer can write a review from the product details dialog: after typing a message in the review field and pressing "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Submit",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ", the review appears in the dialog's "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " list with that message and the customer's e-mail as its author."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "UI"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-2"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Writing a review through the API ("
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "PUT /rest/products/{id}/reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " with the customer's token) answers "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "HTTP 201",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " with "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "{\"status\":\"success\"}",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ". The review is then listed by "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "GET /rest/products/{id}/reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " with the submitted message, the customer's e-mail as "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "author",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ", "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likesCount",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " 0 and an empty "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likedBy",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-3"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "GET /rest/products/{id}/reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " answers "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "HTTP 200",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " with the envelope and review fields described in api-contract.md, with the stated types."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-4"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Writing, liking and editing reviews require a signed-in customer: "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "PUT /rest/products/{id}/reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ", "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "POST /rest/products/reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " and "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "PATCH /rest/products/reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " without a token are refused with "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "HTTP 401",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ", and nothing is stored or changed."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-5"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Only its author can edit a review: a "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "PATCH /rest/products/reviews",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " by another signed-in customer is refused with "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "HTTP 403",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ", and the review's message stays unchanged."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-6"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Reviews and likes record who made them, from the session and not from the request: a review's "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "author",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " is the e-mail of the signed-in customer who wrote it, even when the request names someone else, and each like adds the liking customer's e-mail to the review's "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likedBy",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ". "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likesCount",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " always equals the number of entries in "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likedBy",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-7"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A customer can like a review only once: a second like by the same customer is refused with "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "HTTP 403",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " and "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "{\"error\":\"Not allowed\"}",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ", and "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likesCount",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " and "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likedBy",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " stay as they were after the first like."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-8"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The like-once rule also holds when requests arrive at the same time: when one customer sends several likes for the same review simultaneously, exactly one is counted — "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likesCount",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " rises by 1 and the customer's e-mail appears once in "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likedBy",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-9"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Invalid requests are refused: a like for a review id that does not exist answers "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "HTTP 404",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " with "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "{\"error\":\"Not found\"}",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": ", and in the dialog the "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "Submit",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "strong"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " button stays disabled while the review field is empty."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "API + UI"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-10"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A review message is at most 160 characters: the review field accepts 160 characters and a review of exactly 160 characters can be submitted; a 161st character is not accepted, and the field's counter shows "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "160/160",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "UI"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-11"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "The review form is accessible: the review field has an accessible name, and its accessible description includes the hint \"Max. 160 characters\"; the Submit button has an accessible name."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "UI"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "tableRow",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "AC-12"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "A review keeps its history through its lifecycle: a review written by customer A, liked by customer B and then edited by A shows A's edited message, still names A as its author, and keeps B's like ("
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likesCount",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " 1, "
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "likedBy",
                          "marks": [
                            {
                              "type": "code"
                            }
                          ]
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": " containing B's e-mail)."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "tableCell",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
